{"body":[{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9663_46195_1749.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"p","x":"QINGDAO, China (AVING) -- <Visual News> Daxian presented its GSM/GPRS phone 'C8100' in China market during SINOCES 2007. Adopting note function, the C8100 supports 2.4-inch TFT screen, 1.3M camera, T-Flash card and music/video player."},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9663_46196_1749.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9663_46197_1749.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9663_46198_1749.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9663_46199_1749.jpg","cap":""},{"t":"img","src":"https://cdn.us.aving.net/news/photo/200707/9663_46200_1749.jpg","cap":""}]}